  "description": "Your challenge. Your rules.\n\nSet a goal, pick the duration, add your tasks ΓÇö and show up every day. Run a 15-day sprint, a 30-day reset, a 75-day grind, a 90-day marathon ΓÇö or anything from 1 to 365 days. Better keeps you accountable and makes progress visible.\n\nBuild your challenge\nCreate any habit challenge with custom tasks. Choose binary tasks (done/not done) or incremental ones (track reps, glasses, pages). Set reminders so nothing slips.\n\nSee your transformation\nSnap daily progress photos and compare them side by side. Log weight and body measurements to watch trends over weeks and months. Write journal entries ΓÇö even add voice notes ΓÇö to stay mindful.\n\nStay connected to your health\nSync with Apple Health to auto-track steps, calories, water, sleep, exercise minutes, and more ΓÇö 14 health metrics that update your tasks automatically.\n\nGet coached by AI\nStuck in a rut? Ask your AI coach for advice on habits, motivation, or your weekly progress. It knows your data and gives personalized nudges.\n\nJoin the community\nShare updates, follow friends, cheer each other on with likes and comments. Seeing others show up makes you want to show up too.\n\nCelebrate every win\nUnlock achievements across 9 categories, watch your streak grow on the activity heatmap, and share custom progress cards.\n\nLives on your Home Screen\nHome screen and lock screen widgets let you check off tasks without even opening the app. One tap. Done.\n\nAvailable in 35+ languages.\n\nSubscription\nBetter offers a 7-day free trial so you can explore everything the app has to offer. After the trial, payment will be charged to your Apple ID account. The subscription automatically renews unless it is canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage and cancel your subscription in your Apple ID account settings.\n\nReady to start? Make today Day 1.\n\nTerms of Service:\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://www.joinbetter.app/privacy-policy\n\nContact us:\nalexander.feedback@icloud.com",
